name cldr-supplemental-data
# CLDR's supplemental data. The elements that name one thing by one attribute are read: each says of that thing what
# its other attributes hold, under the attribute's own name, and what the elements inside it say (a territory's
# languagePopulation, a region's currency, a calendar's calendarSystem and era) is said of it, each such element
# together as one record.
match supplementalData.xml
grammar xml
# "Copyright © 1991-2026 Unicode, Inc." and "CLDR data files are interpreted according to the LDML specification"
witness CLDR
identity language type
identity territory type
identity group type
identity region iso3166
identity info iso4217
identity territoryCodes type
identity currencyCodes type
identity calendar type
identity scriptVariant id
identity parentLocale parent
identity reference type
